Depth Anything V2 Small Core ML models

Original model: Depth Anything V2 by Lihe Yang, Bingyi Kang, Zilong Huang,
Zhen Zhao, Xiaogang Xu, Jiashi Feng, and Hengshuang Zhao.
Source: https://github.com/DepthAnything/Depth-Anything-V2
Paper: https://arxiv.org/abs/2406.09414

Core ML packages supplied by Apple:
https://developer.apple.com/machine-learning/models/
https://huggingface.co/apple/coreml-depth-anything-v2-small

The Small models are identified as Apache-2.0 by the upstream README and
Apple's model card. The accompanying DepthAnythingV2-LICENSE preserves the
license text. No model weights were modified. The .mlmodelc directories are
build-generated compilations of the original .mlpackage directories.
The model download URLs and exact package hashes are in models/catalog.json.

These terms do not describe the Base, Large, Giant, or Depth Pro models.
